            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "PROBLEM 2A-19 STRUCTURE MOTION DUE TO AIR SHOCK ",
            "block_bbox": [
                247,
                283,
                937,
                304
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Problem:Determine the maximum horizontal acceleration, displacement and velocity of an above ground structure subjected to air shock.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                342,
                1021,
                394
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Procedure:",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                408,
                263,
                430
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 1.Determine external loadings acting on the roof, front and rear walls according to the procedure outlined in Problem 2A-10.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                447,
                969,
                496
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 2.Construct the horizontal force-time load curve by combining the front and rear wall loadings from Step 1 applied over the area of front and rear walls. Use times of arrival to phase these two loads.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                512,
                1032,
                588
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 3.Calculate the dead weight and mass of the structure.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                603,
                824,
                628
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 4.Construct the downward force-time curve by adding the weight of the structure and total roof load. The roof load is the pressure time loading from Step 1 applied over the total area of the roof.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                643,
                1007,
                720
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 5.Determine the coefficient of friction between soil and the structure from Table 2-12 (+).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                735,
                1010,
                785
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 6.Determine maximum horizontal acceleration, displacement and velocity using the acceleration impulse extrapolation method outlined in Chapter 3,Section 3-19.2.1.2 of this manual. The resisting force at each time interval is equal to the value of downward force curve of Step 4 multiplied by the coefficient of friction determined in Step 5. The resisting force is assumed to be effective when the total horizontal movement is equal to or larger than 1/4 inch as mentioned in Section 2-22.2.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                800,
                1045,
                985
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "2A-102",
            "block_bbox": [
                561,
                1517,
                637,
                1537
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
